type: software
title: "MultiMediaSearchBench: how well AI agents find things in the video, pictures and sound people keep"
abstract: "A benchmark of how well an AI agent, alone or with a search system, finds things in large piles of real video, pictures and sound, with every answer known in advance and graded by fixed rules."
